      {
        "text": "Jennifer Gong-Gershowitz has represented the 17th District in the Illinois House since 2019 and is a human rights attorney. She previously directed the immigration law practice at the North Suburban Legal Aid Clinic and handled pro bono cases against human traffickers.",
