      },
      {
        "text": "She sponsored the Teaching Equitable Asian American Community History Act, which ensures Asian American history is taught in K-12 public schools. She sponsored the Firearm Industry Responsibility Act to allow civil lawsuits against gun manufacturers over their marketing strategies. She chairs the House Democratic AI Working Group and sponsored laws targeting nonconsensual deepfakes and unauthorized AI reproductions of a person's voice or likeness. She led a bipartisan 2026 law to help parents protect their children online.",
